.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ifg-collab 1  "ifg-collab 0.9.0" 
.SH NAME
ifg\-collab \- Coordinate agent sessions, tasks, messages and handoffs
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg collab\fR [\fB\-\-session\-file\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Coordinate agent sessions, tasks, messages and handoffs
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-session\-file\fR \fI<SESSION_FILE>\fR
Private file holding this agent\*(Aqs session credentials
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ifg\-collab\-session(1)
Register, list, heartbeat or end agent sessions
.TP
ifg\-collab\-task(1)
Create, list, view and update collaboration tasks
.TP
ifg\-collab\-message(1)
Send, list and acknowledge task messages
.TP
ifg\-collab\-handoff(1)
Create, list, accept or cancel task handoffs
.TP
ifg\-collab\-inbox(1)
List this session\*(Aqs inbox
.TP
ifg\-collab\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.9.0
